deployYsyProtocolPrincipal
├── Given unauthorized, paused, expired or insufficient settled principal BOLD
│   └── It reverts and never spends reward BOLD
├── Given executor zero output, lie, underspend or unmet minimum
│   └── It rolls back source debit and approvals
├── Given vault zero basis or partial share receipt
│   └── It rolls back nested deposits and accounting
└── Given valid nested Yearn route
    ├── It credits actual ysyBOLD shares and yBOLD basis only
    ├── It clears approvals and never debits ETH twice
    └── Uninvested principal BOLD recovers separately to Safe
